Why this change:
The app needs proper responsive design to work well on mobile devices. This includes touch-friendly navigation (swipe gestures), responsive tables that hide less important columns on small screens, and proper mobile UI patterns like overlays for the sidebar. These changes provide a solid foundation for mobile responsiveness throughout the application.
